<h1 style="margin:0 0 12px;font-size:24px;font-weight:600;">Verify your email</h1>
<p style="margin:0 0 8px;color:#52525b;line-height:1.6;">
  Confirm this address to finish setting up your account at {{store.name}} — this is also what
  lets us attach any past orders placed with this email to your account.
</p>
<p style="margin:24px 0;">
  <a href="{{verifyUrl}}" style="display:inline-block;background:{{store.colorAccent}};color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;padding:10px 20px;border-radius:2px;font-weight:600;">Verify email</a>
</p>
<p style="margin:0;color:#71717a;font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;">
  This link works once and expires in 24 hours. If you did not create this account, you can
  ignore this email.
</p>
